## 5. Overlay rules

This project may carry an overlay layer (expert report, thesis) on top of the
base scaffold. If `docs/*/AGENTS.md` exists, **read it before touching the
publication text** — those rules are binding and take precedence over general
working style. Per the canon's nested-`AGENTS.md` rule they may only narrow what
is written here and in the canon, never contradict it.

An overlay brings its own `project.just` recipes and its own copier answers
file; the two layers update separately:

```bash
copier update                                             # base layer
copier update --answers-file .copier-answers.<overlay>.yml
```

